WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Crouching heavy punch whiffs as Ken recovers.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.500
Jamie’s standing medium and Ken’s wake-up attack hit each other.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Standing medium kick connects after the recorded trade.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
OD Swagger Step launches Ken.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.250
The heavy-kick target follow-up continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:04.400
Jamie drinks while Ken remains knocked down.
